# Room Name - TryHackMe: Snapped Phish-ing Line
Date: 25 July 2026
Difficulty: Easy
Category: Phishing Analysis / OSINT / Threat Investigation

# Scenario
Apply learned skills to probe malicious emails and URLs, exposing a vast phishing campaign. The challenge involved investigating a set of phishing emails targeting employees of swiftspend.finance, tracing the attack infrastructure, downloading and analysing the phishing kit, recovering captured credentials, and decoding a hidden flag from the attacker's server.

# Tools Used
- TryHackMe Attack Box
- Terminal (bash)
- Browser
- VirusTotal
- CyberChef
- sha256sum

